    "text": {
     "text": "Two machines play one game in fixed steps, sending each other only what their players press.\n1. Start a server: cargo run -p jengine-server   (it listens on 127.0.0.1:9001)\n2. Start two copies: cargo run -p jengine-builder --bin jengine -- run projects/engine-test-lab --instances 2\n3. In each copy press 1 to take a seat. A third copy can press 2 to watch.\nClose one player mid-match and start it again: it replays the match so far and takes its seat back.\nH hub  [ ] prev / next",
     "font_id": "",
     "font_scale": 1.0,
     "color": [
      0.7,
      0.75,
      0.85,
      0.9
     ],
